        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WMYBG, Warwick Escutcheon Front Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAcorn's Warwick Escutcheon Front Door Knocker has a traditional design that will lend any door its old world charm. It is made for outdoor use and has a lifetime no-rust warranty. Installation is easy, with only a few screws it can be surfaced mounted to just about any front door. Since the WMYBG Warwick Door Knocker is made out of iron, it is tough enough to ensure that this door knocker will last for many years to come. The uneven surface of rough iron finish duplicates that found on the ironwork of many European castles and cathedrals and imitates natural weathering.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the WMYBG Warwick Rough Black Iron Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Mounted with Included Screws</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
